Haider Ki Zulfiqar Ke Johar Dikhaon Ga.<br>
Khundak Na Khaein Aap Main Khandaq Sunaon Ga.<br>
<br>
1- Khandaq Mein Dekhney Ko Musalman They Bohat.<br>
Zahir Mein Sab Rasool Pe Qurban They Bohat.<br>
Waisay Tu Woh Nabi Ke Nigehban They Bohat.<br>
Bas Ibn-e-Abad-e-Wod Se Pareshan They Bohat.<br>
Hanstay They Unn Ko Dekh Ke Kuffar Mauj Mein.<br>
Kuch They Ohad Ke Bhagney Walay Bhi Foaj Mein.<br>
<br>
2- Lashkar Mein Aisay Mard Bhi Aaye They Be Misal.<br>
Aata Tha Sirf Khaimay Ke Andar Unhein Jalal.<br>
Kartay They Yaad Dil Mein Woh Jang-e-Ohad Ka Haal.<br>
Bhagay They Aisay Sansein Abhi Tak Na Thin Bahaal.<br>
Iss Bar Tu Ajeeb Hai Aafat Pari Hoi.<br>
Pichey Hai Khayi Aagay Hai Khandaq Khudi Hoi.<br>
<br>
3- Kehte They Dil Hi Dil Mein Woh Salman Ko Bura.<br>
Oss Ne Hamarey Sath Yeh Acha Nahi Kiya.<br>
Kyun Mashwara Rasool Ko Khandaq Ka De Diya.<br>
Ajmi Ne Inteqam Yeh Arbon Se Le Liya.<br>
Sarkar Ne Suni Nahi Aakhir Kissi Ki Baat.<br>
Phir Aaj Baton Baton Mein Rakh Li Ossi Ki Baat.<br>
<br>
4- Guzrey Hain Chaar Saal Hi Iss Baat Ko Abhi.<br>
Laye They Pehli Bar Issay Bazm Mein Ali.<br>
Ab Jitna Yeh Qareeb Hai Utna Nahi Koi.<br>
Our Aaj Tu Hadees Bhi Irshad Ho Gayi.<br>
Waqif Azal Se Hai Yeh Hamarey Mizaj Se.<br>
Salman Ahl-e-Bait Mein Shamil Hai Aaj Se.<br>
<br>
5- Kehte They Bees Roz Se Yeh Tees Mar Khan.<br>
Kuch Hain Poraney Dost Bhi Aaye Hoye Yahan.<br>
Aapas Mein Achi Baat Nahi Hain Laraiyaan.<br>
Kuch Tu Karein Khiyal Hamara Sheh-e-Zamaan.<br>
Aisa Na Ho Keh Rishta Porana Yeh Toot Jaye.<br>
Aye Kash Sulha Kar Lein Nabi Jan Choot Jaye.<br>
<br>
6- Ik Roz Amar Ne Yeh Dikhai Bohadari.<br>
Khandaq Ko Paar Kar Ke Idhar Aa Gaya Shaqi.<br>
Khaimon Ke Pas Aa Ke Yeh Aawaz Oss Ne Di.<br>
Itnay Ho Aik Mard Bhi Tum Mein Nahi Koi.<br>
Baithay Hoye Hain Khaimon Mein Munh Ko Chupaye Hain.<br>
Kya Aurton Ko Sath Nabi Le Ke Laye Hain.<br>
<br>
7- Phir Aik Bar Bola Sitamgar Dahaar Kar.<br>
Eman Hai Tumhara Suna Hai Jehad Par.<br>
Maro Ya Marey Jao Gay Maidan Mein Agar.<br>
Janat Mein Tum Ko Milna Hai Apne Khuda Se Ghar.<br>
Lo Main Khara Hoon Apna Muqadar Sanwar Lo.<br>
Mar Jao Mere Hath Se Ya Mujh Ko Mar Lo.<br>
<br>
8- ALLAH Re Oss Ka Khof They Khamosh Sab Ke Sab.<br>
Danton Talay Zaban Thi Our Sil Gaye They Lab.<br>
Din Mein Andhera Cha Gaya Aankhon Mein Misal-e-Shab.<br>
Nagah Aagay Aaya Woh Gustakh Be Adab.<br>
Munh Tak Rahi Thi Maut Bhi Oss Be Usool Ka.<br>
Naizay Se Chak Kar Diya Khaima Rasool Ka.<br>
<br>
9- Gustakh Ne Yeh Be Adabana Kiya Jo Waar.<br>
Kuch Our Dar Ke Hat Gaye Ashab-e-Janisar.<br>
Uth Uth Ke Dekhney Lagi Pehlu Se Zulfiqar.<br>
Aisa Howa Tha Door-e-Payamber Mein Pehli Bar.<br>
Tha Ibn-e-Abad-e-Wod Ka Sitara Zawwal Mein.<br>
Rehmat Ko Kainat Ne Dekha Jalal Mein.